        "epId": 8911,
        "name": "柳佳",
        "desc": "<p>「罗素姆工坊」研究员，那夏镇最好的工坊。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/31/326985891/5a487eb99644637b07499614452021bb_2464081680422740574.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
